      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>(1-4) Sitt al-Na\u1e93ar, the daughter of [Ephraim] \u1e24alf\u014dn, dedicated one quarter of the compound that is in Mahra, leading into the darb, (D\u0101r) Shirkat (A)b\u016b Man\u1e63\u016br b. Mak\u0101rim b. al-Maq\u0101ni\u02bf\u012bya, to al-\u02bfaniy\u012bm.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>(5-6) She also donated an entire sixth of the said compound to Fa\u1e0d\u0101\u02beil b. \u02bfAw\u0101\u02bei\u1e0d b. al-Katt\u0101n\u0101ni, on the condition that the rent should</p>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>(7-8) belong to her as long as she lives and, after she departs from life, to him, his descendants, and his mother, Sitt al-D\u0101r, the daughter of Hiba, as long as they live after her.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\n<li>\n<p>Thereafter, the title of property should be turned over to al-\u02bfaniy\u012bm.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
